# SolidWorks lock/temp files (created while a file is open)
~$*
*.swp
# SolidWorks auto-recover and backups
*.sldbak
*.swbak
Backup of *
*_autorecover*
# Simulation results (large, regenerable) - remove if you want to keep them
*.cwr
*.rst
*.cwr_*
# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.tmp
*.bak
